{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20282","headline":"春日行 · 张籍","name":"春日行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春日融融池上暖，竹牙出土兰心短。\n草堂晨起酒半醒，家僮报我园花满。\n头上皮冠未曾整，直入花间不寻径。\n树树殷勤尽遶行，攀枝未徧春日暝。\n不用积金着青天，不用服药求神仙。\n但愿园里花长好，一生饮酒花前老。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20282.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20282","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}